(m.units[m.selected]?.id)?.name||'No character'}</b><br>Enemy target: click a character on their side.</p><div class="deck-row"><span>Active effects</span><b>${m.units[m.selected]?.status?.join(', ')||'None'}</b></div></aside></div>`;}

