-1" data-card-id="${c.id}" aria-label="Remove ${c.name}">−</button><b>${d[c.id]||0}</b><button data-deck-change="1" data-card-id="${c.id}" aria-label="Add ${c.name}">+</button></span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="divider"></div><button class="button primary" data-action="validate-deck">${count===deckTarget()?'Deck is ready — battle':'Validate deck'}</button></section><section><div class="box"><h3>Your five bunkers</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5">Five bunkers, up to five characters in each. Effects may change these limits during play.</p>${bunkerHtml}</div><div class="box" style="margin-top:14px"><h3>Deck rules</h3><div class="deck-row"><span>Character copies</span><b>5 max each</b></div><div class="deck-row"><span>Energy & supporters</span><b>Unlimited</b></div><div class="deck-row"><span>Battle opening hand</span><b>7 cards</b></div><div class="deck-row"><span>Prize cards</span><b>15 cards</b></div><div class="deck-row"><span>Once per turn</span><b>Attach 1 energy</b></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin:12px 0 0">Special versions count as distinct cards. Supporter effects can override deck limits.</p></div></section></div>`;}
